      "content": "Hey, I'm working on the mood board for our new 'Universal Luxury' campaign. We need to define what the modern elite looks like for the visual team. Can you write a few evocative, high-concept descriptions of a group of people who represent the absolute pinnacle of elegance, success, and global influence? These will be used as prompts for our AI image gen, so make them really vivid and focused on that high-end, prestigious aesthetic.",
