    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Those are good foundations, but they feel a bit like specific character archetypes. For the core of the campaign, I want to focus on that 'universal' feeling—the feeling of pure, unadulterated luxury. Can you give me a few more descriptions that capture that same level of status and extreme beauty? I'm looking for that 'standard' of excellence that people just instinctively associate with the highest levels of prestige and class.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
